              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, shield, thrusting spear, and horse. May have lance (+2 pts) instead of thrusting spear. May have heavy armour (+2 pts). Bosnian Pronijar may count a +1 rank bonus. Not available in the Kingdom of Serbia. (Vlad the Impaler p.70)</characteristic>
