              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear, shield, bow, and horse. May have light armour (+2 pts). Skirmishers. Expert Horsemen. Open Order if wearing light armour. Not available in the Kingdom of Serbia. (Vlad the Impaler p.70)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
